{
  "name": "ELO — modify an envelope",
  "priority": 5,
  "request": {
    "method": "POST",
    "urlPath": "/enveloppe/modifier",
    "headers": {
      "messageCode": { "equalTo": "ENV_MOD01" }
    }
  },
  "response": {
    "status": 200,
    "headers": { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
    "transformers": ["response-template"],
    "jsonBody": {
      "enveloppe": {
        "jeton": "EI202609271130001234A",
        "numeroDossier": "{{jsonPath request.body '$.numeroDossier'}}",
        "statut": "FERMEE",
        "modeCreation": "EDI",
        "informationsAppairage": {
          "sensTraversee": "EXPORT",
          "typeCamion": "PLEIN",
          "estTIRATA": false,
          "possedeContratTransport": true,
          "estPostal": false,
          "estEmballageVide": false,
          "estSPS": false,
          "estProduitPeche": false
        },
        "declarations": [
          {
            "identifiant": "26GB1234567890AB12",
            "typeDeclaration": "EXPORT_SDS",
            "sousTypeDeclaration": "DEPART",
            "informationsValidation": {
              "etat": "A_VALIDER",
              "code": "",
              "message": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "identifiant": "26GB9876543210CD34",
            "typeDeclaration": "EXPORT_SDS",
            "sousTypeDeclaration": "DEPART",
            "informationsValidation": {
              "etat": "A_VALIDER",
              "code": "",
              "message": ""
            }
          }
        ],
        "nombreDeclaration": 2,
        "dateCreation": "{{now offset='-10 minutes'}}",
        "dateModification": "{{now}}",
        "dateValidation": "",
        "procedureSecoursIcs2": false
      }
    }
  },
  "metadata": {
    "comment": [
      "Modification is only legal against a FERMEE envelope that is not yet paired",
      "(see the spec's own description of ENV_MOD01), so the response keeps statut",
      "FERMEE. The stub echoes back whatever numeroDossier the caller sent —",
      "modifierENV identifies the envelope that way, unlike creerENV, which mints",
      "one — and shows a second declaration added, since ENV_MOD01's",
      "identifiantsDeclarationAAjouter/ASupprimer arrays are the whole point of",
      "this operation.",
      "numeroDossier is echoed as a bare scalar via the jsonPath helper; nested",
      "objects are deliberately NOT echoed the same way (see ppns-notifications-",
      "pending.json's comment on Handlebars and escaped quotes) — only scalars are",
      "safe to template here."
    ]
  }
}
